#: includes/templates.php:9
msgid "Personal Tasks"
msgstr "个人任务"

#: includes/templates.php:10
msgid "Turn a busy day into a short, manageable plan."
msgstr "把忙碌的一天变成简短、可执行的计划。"

#: includes/templates.php:12
msgid "Next"
msgstr "接下来"

#: includes/templates.php:13
msgid "Choose today’s three priorities"
msgstr "选择今天的三项优先任务"

#: includes/templates.php:13
msgid "Write down three useful things you can realistically finish today."
msgstr "写下今天实际能够完成的三件有用的事。"

#: includes/templates.php:14
msgid "Gather what you need"
msgstr "收集所需材料"

#: includes/templates.php:14
msgid "Collect the information or materials needed for your first task."
msgstr "收集第一项任务所需的信息或材料。"

#: includes/templates.php:16
msgid "Focus on one small step"
msgstr "专注于一个小步骤"

#: includes/templates.php:16
msgid "Break a large task into one clear next action."
msgstr "将大型任务拆成清晰的下一步行动。"

#: includes/templates.php:21
msgid "Community Event"
msgstr "社区活动"

#: includes/templates.php:22
msgid ""
"Prepare a welcoming event without losing track of the practical details."
msgstr "筹备友好的社区活动，不遗漏实际细节。"

#: includes/templates.php:24 includes/templates.php:93
msgid "Plan"
msgstr "规划"

#: includes/templates.php:25
msgid "Choose the place and date"
msgstr "选择地点和日期"

#: includes/templates.php:25
msgid ""
"Compare suitable places and check availability before confirming a date."
msgstr "比较合适的场地，确认日期前先检查档期。"

#: includes/templates.php:26
msgid "Check accessibility"
msgstr "检查无障碍条件"

#: includes/templates.php:26
msgid ""
"Check step-free access, seating and any other needs your guests may have."
msgstr "检查无台阶通道、座位及参与者的其他需求。"

#: includes/templates.php:28 includes/templates.php:73
msgid "Prepare"
msgstr "准备"

#: includes/templates.php:29
msgid "Plan refreshments"
msgstr "规划茶点"

#: includes/templates.php:29
msgid "Estimate quantities and ask about dietary requirements."
msgstr "估算数量并询问饮食需求。"

#: includes/templates.php:30
msgid "Prepare a welcome checklist"
msgstr "准备迎宾清单"

#: includes/templates.php:30
msgid "List the signs, supplies and information needed on the day."
msgstr "列出当天需要的标识、物资和信息。"

#: includes/templates.php:36
msgid "Moving Home"
msgstr "搬家"

#: includes/templates.php:37
msgid "Keep packing, moving-day essentials and settling in on one board."
msgstr "在一个看板中安排打包、搬家当日用品和安顿事项。"

#: includes/templates.php:39
msgid "Before moving"
msgstr "搬家之前"

#: includes/templates.php:40
msgid "Sort what to keep"
msgstr "整理要保留的物品"

#: includes/templates.php:40
msgid "Choose what to keep, donate or recycle before packing."
msgstr "打包前决定哪些保留、捐赠或回收。"

#: includes/templates.php:41
msgid "Label your boxes"
msgstr "给箱子贴标签"

#: includes/templates.php:41
msgid "Label each box with its room and a short contents list."
msgstr "在每个箱子上标明房间及简要物品清单。"

#: includes/templates.php:43
msgid "Moving day"
msgstr "搬家当天"

#: includes/templates.php:44
msgid "Pack an essentials bag"
msgstr "准备必需品包"

#: includes/templates.php:44
msgid ""
"Keep important documents, chargers and everyday essentials within reach."
msgstr "把重要证件、充电器及日常用品放在随手可取处。"

#: includes/templates.php:45
msgid "Check keys and access"
msgstr "检查钥匙和出入方式"

#: includes/templates.php:45
msgid "Confirm how and when you can enter the new home."
msgstr "确认何时、如何进入新家。"

#: includes/templates.php:47
msgid "Settling in"
msgstr "安顿新家"

#: includes/templates.php:47
msgid "Check essential services"
msgstr "检查基本服务"

#: includes/templates.php:47
msgid "Check electricity, water and other essential services after arrival."
msgstr "到达后检查电力、供水和其他基本服务。"

#: includes/templates.php:51
msgid "Freelance Client Project"
msgstr "自由职业客户项目"

#: includes/templates.php:52
msgid "Deliver a client project from a clear brief to an agreed handover."
msgstr "从明确需求开始，完成约定的项目交付。"

#: includes/templates.php:54
msgid "Brief and scope"
msgstr "需求与范围"

#: includes/templates.php:55
msgid "Confirm the client brief"
msgstr "确认客户需求"

#: includes/templates.php:55
msgid ""
"Write the goal, audience, deliverables, budget and target date. Ask the "
"client to confirm what is included and excluded."
msgstr "写明目标、受众、交付物、预算和目标日期。请客户确认包含和不包含的内容。"

#: includes/templates.php:56
msgid "Collect content and access requirements"
msgstr "收集内容和访问需求"

#: includes/templates.php:56
msgid ""
"List the files, brand material and permissions you need. Share credentials "
"through a secure channel, never inside a card."
msgstr "列出所需文件、品牌素材和权限。通过安全渠道共享凭据，绝不写在卡片里。"

#: includes/templates.php:59
msgid "Prepare the first deliverable"
msgstr "准备首次交付"

#: includes/templates.php:59
msgid ""
"Break the agreed work into a small reviewable delivery. Add acceptance "
"criteria so both sides know what finished means."
msgstr "把约定工作拆成小型、可评审的交付。加入验收标准，让双方明白完成的含义。"

#: includes/templates.php:61
msgid "Client Review"
msgstr "客户评审"

#: includes/templates.php:62
msgid "Collect feedback in one place"
msgstr "集中收集反馈"

#: includes/templates.php:62
msgid ""
"Ask for one consolidated feedback list. Confirm changes against the agreed "
"scope before starting extra work."
msgstr "请客户提供一份汇总反馈。开始额外工作前，将变更与约定范围进行核对。"

#: includes/templates.php:64
msgid "Handover"
msgstr "交接"

#: includes/templates.php:65
msgid "Prepare handover and invoice checklist"
msgstr "准备交接与开票清单"

#: includes/templates.php:65
msgid ""
"Confirm approval, provide agreed files and instructions, and check "
"invoicing. Replace these starter tasks with your own work."
msgstr "确认批准，交付约定文件和说明，检查开票情况。请将这些初始任务替换为自己的工作。"

#: includes/templates.php:70
msgid "WordPress Maintenance"
msgstr "WordPress 维护"

#: includes/templates.php:71
msgid ""
"A manual checklist for safer site checks, updates and verification; nothing "
"runs automatically."
msgstr "用于更安全检查、更新和验证站点的手动清单；不会自动执行任何操作。"

#: includes/templates.php:74
msgid "Confirm scope and a recoverable backup"
msgstr "确认范围和可恢复的备份"

#: includes/templates.php:74
msgid ""
"Agree the sites and maintenance window. Verify a recent files-and-database "
"backup and a recovery method before changing anything."
msgstr "商定站点和维护时间窗。更改前确认有近期文件及数据库备份，并具备恢复方法。"

#: includes/templates.php:75
msgid "Review updates on a test copy"
msgstr "在测试副本中检查更新"

#: includes/templates.php:75
msgid ""
"Check core, plugin and theme changes on a separate test copy. Review "
"compatibility notes and identify a rollback plan."
msgstr "在独立测试副本中检查核心、插件和主题变更。查看兼容性说明并制定回滚计划。"

#: includes/templates.php:77
msgid "Maintain"
msgstr "维护"

#: includes/templates.php:78
msgid "Apply the approved changes"
msgstr "应用已批准的更改"

#: includes/templates.php:78
msgid ""
"After approval, apply the tested changes during the agreed window. Record "
"what changed; do not place passwords or private backup links in this card."
msgstr "获得批准后，在约定时间内应用测试过的更改。记录变更，不要在此卡片中放置密码或私有备份链接。"

#: includes/templates.php:80
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "验证"

#: includes/templates.php:81
msgid "Check visitor and administrator journeys"
msgstr "检查访客与管理员操作流程"

#: includes/templates.php:81
msgid ""
"Check key pages, forms and wp-admin. If relevant, verify login and checkout "
"with appropriate test accounts. Record errors and screenshots."
msgstr "检查主要页面、表单和 wp-admin。如适用，使用合适的测试账户验证登录和结账。记录错误和截图。"

#: includes/templates.php:82
msgid "Review security and performance signals"
msgstr "检查安全与性能信号"

#: includes/templates.php:82
msgid ""
"Review available error logs, security alerts and page performance. Record "
"findings before deciding further changes."
msgstr "检查可用的错误日志、安全警报和页面性能。记录发现后，再决定进一步更改。"

#: includes/templates.php:84
msgid "Report"
msgstr "报告"

#: includes/templates.php:85
msgid "Send a clear maintenance report"
msgstr "发送清晰的维护报告"

#: includes/templates.php:85
msgid ""
"Summarize completed checks, versions changed, issues and follow-up actions. "
"Set future maintenance dates yourself; this board does not schedule or "
"perform updates."
msgstr "汇总已完成的检查、变更版本、问题和后续行动。请自行设置未来维护日期；此看板不会安排或执行更新。"

#: includes/templates.php:90
msgid "Project Delivery"
msgstr "项目交付"

#: includes/templates.php:91
msgid "Move a shared project from scope and ownership to review and handover."
msgstr "将共享项目从范围和负责人安排推进到评审与交接。"

#: includes/templates.php:94
msgid "Define the outcome and acceptance criteria"
msgstr "定义成果与验收标准"

#: includes/templates.php:94
msgid ""
"Describe who benefits, the problem being solved and how the team will check "
"success."
msgstr "说明受益人、要解决的问题以及团队如何确认成功。"

#: includes/templates.php:95
msgid "Break the work into owned tasks"
msgstr "将工作拆分为有负责人的任务"

#: includes/templates.php:95
msgid ""
"Create small tasks with a clear expected result. Agree owners and dates "
"before adding them to the real project."
msgstr "创建预期结果明确的小任务。在加入实际项目前，先商定负责人和日期。"

#: includes/templates.php:98
msgid "Deliver the next reviewable step"
msgstr "交付下一个可评审阶段"

#: includes/templates.php:98
msgid ""
"Work on one agreed task and record decisions. If work is blocked, explain "
"what is needed and who can help."
msgstr "推进一项约定任务并记录决定。如果受阻，请说明需要什么以及谁能提供帮助。"

#: includes/templates.php:100
msgid "Review"
msgstr "评审"

#: includes/templates.php:101
msgid "Check the result with the intended users"
msgstr "与目标用户检查成果"

#: includes/templates.php:101
msgid ""
"Compare the delivery with the acceptance criteria. Record test evidence and "
"request approval before calling it complete."
msgstr "将交付与验收标准比较。记录测试证据，并在认定完成前请求批准。"

#: includes/templates.php:104
msgid "Record handover and follow-up work"
msgstr "记录交接和后续工作"

#: includes/templates.php:104
msgid ""
"Confirm the result is accepted, share usage instructions and move unfinished"
" follow-ups to separate tasks. List names alone do not mark tasks complete "
"for AI summaries."
msgstr "确认验收、分享使用说明，并将未完后续工作拆成独立任务。列表名称本身不会在 AI 摘要中将任务标记为完成。"

#: includes/templates.php:113
msgid "Choose an available template."
msgstr "请选择可用模板。"

#: includes/templates.php:114
msgid ""
"This template has changed. Review its current preview before creating a "
"board."
msgstr "此模板已更改。创建看板前请检查当前预览。"

#: includes/templates.php:119 includes/templates.php:131
msgid "Board templates"
msgstr "看板模板"

#: includes/templates.php:131
msgid ""
"Start with a practical example. Preview its lists and starter tasks before "
